---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Conformance - Soustack Specification">
  <h1>Conformance</h1>
  
  <div class="section">
    <p>Conformance testing ensures that implementations correctly interpret and validate Soustack documents according to the specification.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Conformance Fixtures</h2>
    <p>The specification includes test fixtures that demonstrate valid and invalid document structures:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/fixtures/valid/">Valid Fixtures</a> — Examples that conform to the specification</li>
      <li><a href="/fixtures/invalid/">Invalid Fixtures</a> — Examples that should be rejected by validators</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Validation</h2>
    <p>Implementations should validate documents against the canonical schemas available at:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/soustack.schema.json">Root Schema</a></li>
      <li><a href="/defs/">Definition Schemas</a></li>
      <li><a href="/stacks/">Stack Schemas</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

